> The value follows the wrapped task and ordinary tasks it `co_await`s, including
> across suspension and executor changes. `AsyncScope::add()` starts its child on
> a new async-stack chain, so the child does not inherit the caller's value unless
> it is wrapped explicitly. Heap and sampling profilers do not currently transport
> the value.
